      {
        "id": "pack_bug_story_bee",
        "title": "教室里的蜜蜂",
        "titlePinyin": "jiàoshì lǐ de mìfēng",
        "titleEnglish": "A Bee in the Classroom",
        "level": 2,
        "theme": "<i class=\"fas fa-bug\" style=\"color:#f59e0b\"></i>",
        "image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamDzX/hanyu-packs/main/images/pack_bug_story_bee.jpg",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "chinese": "上课的时候，一只蜜蜂从窗户飞进了教室。",
            "pinyin": "Shàngkè de shíhou, yì zhī mìfēng cóng chuānghu fēi jìn le jiàoshì.",
            "english": "During the lesson, a bee flew in through the window.",
