              },
              {
                "hanzi": "教室",
                "pinyin": "jiàoshì",
                "english": "classroom"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "chinese": "同学们都很紧张，因为大家怕被它叮。",
            "pinyin": "Tóngxuémen dōu hěn jǐnzhāng, yīnwèi dàjiā pà bèi tā dīng.",
            "english": "The students were all nervous, because everyone was afraid of being stung.",
            "words": [
              {
                "hanzi": "紧张",
                "pinyin": "jǐnzhāng",
                "english": "nervous"
              },
              {
