                "hanzi": "叮",
                "pinyin": "dīng",
                "english": "to sting (of an insect)"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "chinese": "老师说：“别动，它只是在找花。”",
            "pinyin": "Lǎoshī shuō: “Bié dòng, tā zhǐshì zài zhǎo huā.”",
            "english": "The teacher said: “Don't move, it is only looking for flowers.”",
            "words": [
              {
                "hanzi": "别动",
                "pinyin": "bié dòng",
                "english": "don't move"
