            "chinese": "蜜蜂在教室里飞了一圈，就飞出去了。",
            "pinyin": "Mìfēng zài jiàoshì lǐ fēi le yì quān, jiù fēi chūqù le.",
            "english": "The bee flew one lap around the classroom, then flew out.",
            "words": [
              {
                "hanzi": "一圈",
                "pinyin": "yì quān",
