        "image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TeamDzX/hanyu-packs/main/images/pack_bug_story_silkworm.jpg",
        "sentences": [
          {
            "chinese": "春天的时候，科学课的老师给我们每人几只蚕。",
            "pinyin": "Chūntiān de shíhou, kēxué kè de lǎoshī gěi wǒmen měi rén jǐ zhī cán.",
            "english": "In spring, our science teacher gave each of us a few silkworms.",
